00:54:15,436 --> 00:54:16,356
[SPEAKER_01]: His brother, Steve.

1011
00:54:17,117 --> 00:54:25,139
[SPEAKER_01]: But every time, I was on first this one day, and I always said, if I, whenever a fight breaks out, I'm not getting near Kameli, because he had arms about like that, and he was a

