1015
00:54:37,865 --> 00:54:41,607
[SPEAKER_01]: And when the fight broke out, see, so I drifted away.

1016
00:54:43,129 --> 00:54:53,857
[SPEAKER_01]: And that was when I was in Cincinnati and we had a, we had a merry-go-round that day because I know Thompson got his, the tendons cut in his foot and his leg.

