[SPEAKER_01]: I don't know.

1020
00:54:59,028 --> 00:55:01,529
[SPEAKER_01]: I always hit them behind, you know, and you walk around.

1021
00:55:02,409 --> 00:55:13,174
[SPEAKER_01]: But anyway, the fight I really laughed at in Brooklyn, I was with the Cardinals, and like I told you before, there was a fight every time we went into Brooklyn.

