1032
00:55:52,640 --> 00:55:53,621
[SPEAKER_01]: I never will forget it.

1033
00:55:55,442 --> 00:56:05,505
[SPEAKER_01]: When he was laying there on the ground like that, Marion walked over, you know, he was about 6'3", and boy, he just reached over and Medwick was just coming up like this off the ground when Marion hit him.

1034
00:56:06,225 --> 00:56:12,627
