1042
00:56:37,226 --> 00:56:38,586
[SPEAKER_01]: Drawl, you know, big drawl.

1043
00:56:39,987 --> 00:56:45,988
[SPEAKER_01]: And we got in the clubhouse afterwards, and he had two, boy, he had two of the prettiest black eyes you've ever seen.

1044
00:56:46,048 --> 00:56:47,368
[SPEAKER_01]: And what happened, Sam said,

1045
00:56:48,505 --> 00:56:52,426
