1046
00:56:52,446 --> 00:56:57,888
[SPEAKER_01]: He said, I just down in the bullpen and walked up to see what happened, and Freddy Fitzsimmons hit him right between the eyes.

1047
00:57:00,108 --> 00:57:01,809
[SPEAKER_01]: Boy, he had two beauties.

1048
00:57:03,429 --> 00:57:09,371
[SPEAKER_01]: But that night, hey, they had police out there, wouldn't let us out of the clubhouse till about 2 o'clock in the morning.

1049
00:57:09,691 --> 00:57:12,832
