1050
00:57:12,852 --> 00:57:15,273
[SPEAKER_01]: Hey, it was rough that night.

1051
00:57:15,333 --> 00:57:15,873
[SPEAKER_01]: I'm down here.

1052
00:57:18,012 --> 00:57:20,894
[SPEAKER_01]: But they, there was always a scrap over there.

1053
00:57:21,834 --> 00:57:26,957
