[SPEAKER_01]: Well, the club didn't like the St. Louis players, see.

1057
00:57:42,225 --> 00:57:45,107
[SPEAKER_01]: For some reason, I wasn't with them when Medwick was there, see.

1058
00:57:45,247 --> 00:57:45,967
[SPEAKER_01]: Medwick had left

1059
