01:03:03,928 --> 01:03:05,890
[SPEAKER_02]: This is the next day, next night.

1176
01:03:06,891 --> 01:03:15,077
[SPEAKER_02]: Wednesday night, August 6, I think it is, 1975.

1177
01:03:16,978 --> 01:03:19,861
[SPEAKER_02]: And I want to finish up this tape with a little bit of

1178
